      "cooked": "<p>When playing Thunderspeaker, when using the innate ability that lets you gather/push, if you gather 3 dahan into a space with a scenario token and then push a dahan out of that space, do you get to uncover that token? (There was technically 3 dahan in that spot half way through the power.) I guess this question could also apply to the plague spirit too since it has a card that lets you push dahan half way through the card.</p>",
